          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore pee einyototo iltung'ana te ina ang tadekenya enasirie ng'ura etigilaki olperere lo lasar le Baal, ore ina Ashera apa natii embata enye netudung'oki meirraga te nkop, ore ilo oing'oni li are neitaaki olasar te nchumata e ilo perere lo lasar oteshetaki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejokino ninche maate, “Kaing'ae otaasa ena?” Ore ake pee eidip aatakekenu neikilikuanu, nejo ninche, “Gideon olayioni le Yoash otaasa ena.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki iltung'ana te ina ang Yoash, “Mpang'unye olayioni lino, pee etum atua, amu etusulua ninye olperere lo lasar le Baal, netudung'o ina Ashera natashare.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki Yoash lelo pooki apa ooing'orunore ninye, “Ai Baal ing'oring'oro intae? Arashu orrekie lenye igolielie? Ore oloba anaa oloing'or ninye neyookini aar metua tadekenya. Tenaa ke nkai ninye nchoo eing'or kewan amu etusulayioki aauroo olperere lenye lo lasar.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neaku ore ebaiki ina olong etaa keji ninye Yerubaal, aa taa, “Nchoo Baal eng'or agilunore ninye” amu etusulayie ninye auroo olperere lenye lo lasar.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitoki iltung'ana le Midian o le Amaleki o iltung'ana le nkalo o loo saen aaipotuno te nebo, nelang'u Yordan neshet ilng'oborri to oerata le Yesereel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nelotu Enkiyang'et o Laitoriani shumata Gideon, neosh ninye entarumpeta neipotuni iltung'ana le Abiesiri metusujai ninye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neirriwaa ninye ilkiliku meshomo atua Manase pooki, neipotuni sii ninche metusujai ninche. Neitoki airriwaa ilkiliku meshomo Asheri, o Sebulon, o Naftali neilep ninche aapuo aanang'are ninche.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitoki Gideon ajoki Enkai, “Tenaa eikordu iyie Israel te nkaina ai anaa enitejo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ng'ura, kairragie nanu endapana enker te wueji neidong'ieki enkano; ore ake pee ejing enkoleelio endapana ake, netoyio enkae wueji pooki, nayiolou taa ajo ikordu iyie Israel te nkaina ai, anaa enitejo iyie.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Netiu neijia. Ore ake pee einyototo ninye tadekenya enasirie neirony ina dapana, neironyu enkoileelio naiputa olbakuli enkare. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitoki Gideon ajoki Enkai, “Mincho iyie engoro ino eyupuyup ti alo nanu, kake nchooki nanu mairoro ena kata nabo ake, aatoomono, nchooki nanu manyaaki atem ena kata nabo endapana; aatoomono, nchoo endapana ake metoyio, ore enkae kop pooki nchoo ejing enkoileelio.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neiko Enkai neijia ina kewarie; amu etoyio apa endapana ake, ore enkop pooki nejing enkoileelio.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
